    "title": "Game Engineer",
    "long_instructions": "## **Which loop?**\r\n\r\n> #### You're a Game Engineer reviewing two systems an AI wrote for your game:\r\n> 1. A boss fight that spawns enemies until the boss is defeated.\r\n> 2. A respawn timer that counts down for exactly ten seconds.\r\n>    \r\n> For each, would you use a for loop or a while loop? And what's one thing you'd check before accepting either as a Game Engineer?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
